        "dataset_specification": {
          "description": "100%-agreement subset of Financial PhraseBank; original 4,841 sentences, 2,264 in subset, 2,263 remaining after preprocessing; split 64%/16%/20% into train/dev/test with label distribution preserved."
        },
        "data_preprocessing_details": "CCG parsing with BobcatParser; sentences split into chunks of at most 5 words; rule-based preprocessing for passive constructions, compound prepositions, proper nouns, URLs/symbol sequences, as+past participle, to+verb, and sentence-initial discourse markers; vocabulary rewriting/tagging for financial terms; parameter sharing by rewrite labels.",
        "evaluation_methodology": "Single train/dev/test split; dev macro-F1 used for model selection and threshold tuning; test accuracy and macro-F1 reported; explanation metrics computed on test set."
